@startuml
title TutorLink - Casos de uso de seguimiento, asistencia y alertas

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor Docente
actor "Tutor academico" as tutor
actor Estudiante
actor "Padre, madre o\ntutor legal" as guardian
actor "Administrador de\ninstitucion" as admininst
actor "Proceso automatico\ndel sistema" as scheduler
actor "Servicio externo de\nmensajeria WhatsApp" as whatsapp

rectangle "TutorLink - Seguimiento preventivo" {
  usecase "Registrar asistencia" as UC_RegisterAttendance
  usecase "Consultar asistencia" as UC_ViewAttendance
  usecase "Consultar porcentaje\nde asistencia" as UC_AttendanceRate
  usecase "Consultar progreso\npersonal" as UC_StudentProgress
  usecase "Consultar progreso\nde estudiantes asignados" as UC_AssignedProgress
  usecase "Consultar seguimiento\ngeneral institucional" as UC_InstitutionProgress
  usecase "Consultar tareas\npendientes y entregadas" as UC_ViewTaskStatus
  usecase "Notificar nueva tarea" as UC_NewTaskNotification
  usecase "Notificar recordatorio\nprevio al cierre" as UC_ReminderNotification
  usecase "Cerrar tarea y\nactualizar estado" as UC_CloseTask
  usecase "Evaluar reglas de\nalerta academica" as UC_EvaluateAlerts
  usecase "Generar alerta\npreventiva" as UC_GenerateAlert
  usecase "Notificar a usuarios\ninvolucrados" as UC_NotifyStakeholders
  usecase "Enviar notificacion al\nfamiliar por WhatsApp" as UC_SendWhatsApp
  usecase "Notificar alerta a\nactores autorizados" as UC_SendAlert
  usecase "Consultar alertas\nacademicas" as UC_ViewAlerts
  usecase "Consultar seguimiento\npermitido del estudiante" as UC_GuardianTracking
  usecase "Configurar umbrales\nde alertas" as UC_AlertSettings
}

docente --> UC_RegisterAttendance
docente --> UC_ViewAttendance
docente --> UC_AssignedProgress
docente --> UC_ViewAlerts
docente --> UC_NotifyStakeholders

tutor --> UC_AssignedProgress
tutor --> UC_ViewAlerts
tutor --> UC_NotifyStakeholders

estudiante --> UC_ViewAttendance
estudiante --> UC_AttendanceRate
estudiante --> UC_StudentProgress
estudiante --> UC_NotifyStakeholders

guardian --> UC_ViewAlerts
guardian --> UC_GuardianTracking
guardian --> UC_NotifyStakeholders

admininst --> UC_InstitutionProgress
admininst --> UC_AlertSettings
admininst --> UC_ViewAlerts

scheduler --> UC_NewTaskNotification
scheduler --> UC_ReminderNotification
scheduler --> UC_CloseTask
scheduler --> UC_EvaluateAlerts

UC_ViewAttendance .> UC_AttendanceRate : <<include>>
UC_StudentProgress .> UC_ViewTaskStatus : <<include>>
UC_AssignedProgress .> UC_StudentProgress : <<include>>
UC_InstitutionProgress .> UC_AssignedProgress : <<include>>
UC_EvaluateAlerts .> UC_GenerateAlert : <<include>>
UC_GenerateAlert .> UC_SendAlert : <<include>>
UC_SendAlert .> UC_NotifyStakeholders : <<include>>
UC_SendWhatsApp .> UC_SendAlert : <<extend>>
UC_NewTaskNotification .> UC_SendAlert : <<extend>>
UC_ReminderNotification .> UC_SendAlert : <<extend>>
UC_CloseTask .> UC_SendAlert : <<extend>>

UC_SendWhatsApp --> whatsapp

note bottom of UC_EvaluateAlerts
Ejemplos de criterio configurable:
umbral de tareas no entregadas
o umbral de inasistencias.
end note

note bottom of UC_GuardianTracking
El familiar no recibe acceso total:
solo seguimiento y datos permitidos
por politicas institucionales.
end note

note bottom of UC_SendWhatsApp
Se usa cuando existe un vinculo familiar autorizado
y la regla de alerta habilita WhatsApp como canal.
Docentes, tutores y estudiantes reciben las
notificaciones correspondientes dentro de TutorLink.
end note

@enduml
